EFS instead of[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]PENDING, RETURNED, and REFERENCES; the Returned walk tier is [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]renamed Tickler across bob-cli, bob-plugins, the Bob vault, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]SASE memory; and a new glossary term defines the review footer.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]review_footer_short_labels_tickler.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/review_footer_short_labels_tickler.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-55[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-55/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli rename, schema 10, and docs[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-tickler[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-tickler: rename the Rust returned walk tier to tickler (TICKLER in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]human output), bump bob freshness JSON to schema 10, update tests and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the D4 fixture vector, and document the tickler tier, the WIP alias, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the footer short labels in bob-cli docs and README.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-plugins rename, footer short labels, and deploy[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plugins-tickler-footer[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins-tickler-footer: in linked bob-plugins, rename the returned tier [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to tickler in bob-ledger-tools and bob-navigation-hotkeys (freshness [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]namespace v8, nav legacy read), add WIP/TICKS/REFS footer labels with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]legend tooltip, update tests and README, bump both plugin versions, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]build, test, and run bob plugins sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vault notes, glossary term, memory updates, and final sweep[/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault-and-memory[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-tickler, plugins-tickler-footer[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault-and-memory: rename RETURNED to TICKLER on live Bob vault surfaces [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](rotten.md heading and links included), add the Morning GTD Review [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Footer glossary term, update the task-freshness and keep-streak strands [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and four decision records in place, regenerate memory with sase memory [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]init, and sweep all three repositories for leftover references.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-55","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-55.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-fec71f7c75e46b3d03393f18dfe33502","started_at":"2026-10-07T13:56:27.703053+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-55","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-55.1","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-55.2","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-55.3","bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-55.land"]}
